62.6; IR νmax/cm-1 2972, 1595, 1502, 1275, 1176, 1118, 1026; MP 136 - 142
°C; HRMS (ESI+): calcd. for C38H35F6N3O3PS [M+H]+ 758.2035, found
758.2028. Crystal data C38H34F6N3O3PS M r = 757.73 Trigonal, P3221 a =
