$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (12)
(1R,3R,4R,5R)-5,6-Diamino-3,4-O-isopropylidene-7-aza-2-oxabicyclo[3.3.0]oct-6-ene
(8). To a solution of compound 2 (0.20 g, 0.85 mmol) in 10 mL of THF-H2O
(4:1) was added 0.25 g (0.93 mmol) of PPh3. After stirring overnight at
r.t., the reaction mixture was evaporated and extracted with Et2O and
H2O. The aqueous layer was evaporated to give product. Slight yellow
syrup, yield 0.16 g, 89%. [α]D20 20 (c 0.17, CHCl3). IR (ATR): 2988,
1655, 1374, 1217, 1165, 1086, 1007, 877, 733 cm-1. 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ =
5.80 (d, 1 H, H-1, J1,2 = 3.9 Hz), 4.60 (d, 1 H, H-2), 4.30 (d, 1 H, H-4,
J4,5a = 3.0 Hz), 3.72 (dd, 1 H, H-5a, J5a,5b = 14.0 Hz), 3.67 (d, 1 H,
H-5b), 1.53 (s, 3 H, CH3), 1.35 (s, 3 H, CH3). 13C NMR (CDCl3): δ = 168.2
(C=N), 112.9 (CH3CCH3), 106.1 (C-1), 85.1 (C-4), 82.2 (C-2), 74.1 (C-3),
55.5 (C-5), 27.6, 27.3 (2 × CH3). HRMS: m/z calcd for C9H16N3O3 [M + H]+:
214.1192; found: 214.1196. Anal. Calcd for C9H15N3O3: C, 50.69; H, 7.09;
N, 19.71. Found: C, 50.54; H, 6.95; N, 19.60.
