$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: (24) p-Tolyl
4,6-O-Benzylidene-2-acetamino-3-azido-2,3-dideoxy-1-thio-α-d-allopyranoside
(1b): To a solution of 1a (64.2 mg, 0.15 mmol) in anhyd THF (4.0 mL) was
added PPh3 (44.0 mg, 0.167 mmol, 1.1 equiv), and the mixture was stirred
at 65 °C for 8 h. Then H2O (2.0 mL) was added, and the mixture was
stirred at 65 °C for another 8 h. The reaction mixture was concentrated
to dryness. The resulting residue was dissolved in py (3.0 mL) and Ac2O
(1.5 mL) was added dropwise at 0 °C. The mixture was stirred for 6 h at
r.t. and the solvent was removed under vacuum. The residue was purified
by column chromatography on silica gel (PE-EtOAc, 3:1 to 2:1) yielding
the title compound 1b. Compound 4b, yield 88%.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective
