$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Synthesis of Enamines 3; Typical Procedure
Synthesis of 3-[(2,2-Diethoxyethyl)amino]-1-phenylbut-2-en-1-one (3x) To
benzoylacetone (0.200 g, 1.2 mmol) and 2-azido-1,1-diethoxyethane (2)
(0.236 g, 1.5 mmol) in THF (10 mL) was added Ph3P (0.656 g, 2.5 mmol) at
20 °C. The reaction mixture was heated and stirred for 8 h at reflux.
After cooling to 20 °C, the solvent was removed in vacuo and the residue
was purified by column chromatography (silica gel, n-hexane-EtOAc, 100:1
→ 1:1) to give 3x. Isopropyl 3-[(2,2-Diethoxyethyl)amino]but-2-enoate
(3c) Starting with isopropyl acetoacetate (1c) (0.44 mL, 3.0 mmol),
2-azido-1,1-diethoxyethane (2a) (0.573 g, 3.6 mmol) and Ph3P (1.180 g,
4.5 mmol) in THF (15 mL), 3c was isolated after chromatography (silica
gel, n-hexane-EtOAc, 100:1 → 3:1) as a colorless oil (0.673 g, 87%). IR
(neat): 3288 (w), 2980 (s), 2932 (s), 2882 (m), 1651 (s), 1608 (s), 1502
(m), 1451 (s), 1377 (s), 1284 (s), 1241 (s), 1176 (s), 1140 (s), 1113
(s), 1067 (s), 993 (m), 948 (w), 790 (m), 705 cm-1 (w). 1H NMR (CDCl3,
300 MHz): δ = 1.21 (d, J = 6.0 Hz, 6 H, 2 × CH3), 1.25 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 6
H, 2 × CH3), 1.93 (s, 3 H, CH3), 3.33 (dd, J = 6.3, 5.7 Hz, 2 H, NCH2),
3.51-3.61 (m, 2 H, OCH2), 3.68-3.78 (m, 2 H, OCH2), 4.44 (s, 1 H, CH=C),
4.50 (t, J = 5.7 Hz, 1 H, OCH), 4.99 (sept, J = 6.0 Hz, 1 H, OCH), 8.63
(br s, 1 H, NH). 13C NMR (CDCl3, 75 MHz): δ = 14.8 (2 C), 19.1, 21.7 (2
C, CH3), 45.5 (NCH2), 62.6 (2 C, OCH2), 64.3 (OCH), 83.2 (CH=C), 101.6
(OCH), 160.8 (N-C=CH), 169.4 (O=C-O). MS (EI, 70 eV): m/z (%) = 259 (M+,
7), 214 (6), 200 (9), 172 (3), 154 (3), 126 (8), 113 (13), 103 (100), 96
(31), 85 (16), 75 (65). HRMS (ESI): m/z calcd for C13H25NO4 [M+]:
259.17836; found: 259.17861.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM safety, Staudinger-aza-Wittig reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of 3-acylpyrroles, 3-(alkoxycarbonyl)pyrroles,
1,5,6,7-tetrahydro-4H-indol-4-ones and 3-benzoylpyridines based on
Staudinger-aza-Wittig reactions of 1,3-dicarbonyl compounds with 2- and
3-azido-1,1-dialkoxyalkanes
