$DATUM Compound S18-1 (56 mg, 0.0523 mmol) and PPh3 (27 mg, 0.1046 mmol) were
dissolved in benzene (600 μL) and H2O (6 μL). Then, the mixture was
stirred at 60°C for 12 h. After completion of reaction monitored by TLC,
the reaction mixture was condensed under reduced pressure and
re-dissolved in anhydrous THF (300 μL). Cerotic acid (48 mg, 0.1203
mmol), EDCI (23 mg, 0.1203 mmol) and DMAP (catalytic amount) were added
to the corresponding mixture and stirred at r.t. for 24 h. After reaction
completion, the resulting mixture was diluted with EtOAc and washed with
brine. The combined organic layer was dried over anhydrous Na2SO4(s). The
filtrate was condensed under reduced pressure and purified by silica-gel
flash column chromatography (EtOAc : Hex = 1 : 3, v/v) to provide the
desired product S19-1. Colorless oil, yield 63 mg, 85%. [α]D20 -2.7 (c =
0.9, CHCl3); 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.53 (s, 1H), 7.41 (s, 1H),
7.37-7.21 (m, 30H), 6.16 (d, J = 9.5 Hz, 1H), 4.91 (d, J = 11.5 Hz, 1H),
4.80-4.71 (m, 5H), 4.63 (d, J = 11.5 Hz, 1H), 4.57-4.54 (m, 2H),
4.49-4.45 (m, 3H), 4.36 (d, J = 12.0 Hz, 1H), 4.22 (d, J = 12.0 Hz, 1H),
4.10-4.01 (m, 4H), 3.95-3.86 (m, 5H), 3.55 (dd, J = 10.5, 3.5 Hz, 1H),
3.48 (dd, J = 9.3, 6.8 Hz, 1H), 3.36 (dd, J = 9.3, 6.2 Hz, 1H), 1.96-1.87
(m, 2H), 1.83-1.80 (m, 2H), 1.51-1.47 (m, 2H), 1.31-1.23 (m, 60H),
0.91-0.86 (m, 6H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 172.9, 139.7, 138.8, 138.7,
138.6, 137.8, 129.6, 128.61, 128.59, 128.56, 128.54, 128.48, 128.45,
128.2, 128.1, 128.06, 128.0, 127.9, 127.8 127.6, 117.5, 99.8, 80.9, 79.0,
77.4, 75.2, 74.9, 74.5, 73.7, 73.6, 73.1, 70.3, 70.1, 69.6, 69.4, 52.5,
50.2, 36.9, 32.1, 30.6, 29.91, 29.87, 29.83, 29.79, 29.7, 29.61, 29.58,
29.54, 29.4, 26.9, 25.9, 24.7, 22.9, 14.3; LRMS(ESI+) m/z calcd for
C92H132N3O9 [M+H]+: 1423.00; Found: 1423.07.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Staudinger reaction in stage 1
